+On an empty Mk3, generate a new seed. Record and verify its backup, wallet
+fingerprint, and a receive address.
+Restore the affected seed and send a small test transaction to the verified
+address.
+Restore the new seed and confirm that its fingerprint matches and the test
+funds arrived.
+Restore the affected seed and move the remaining funds.
+Restore the new seed and confirm the migration. Keep the old backup until
+the complete balance has arrived and is confirmed.
+The fixed firmware’s device-generated seed is sufficient. Dice rolls are
